Package: uzunyx-timer
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: emi <285864120+antarest47@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, systemd
Recommends: ocean-sound-theme, pipewire-bin | pulseaudio-utils
Description: Timers of the Uzunyx desktop
 Command that starts, lists and cancels timers, as transient systemd user
 timers. When one ends it shows a notification that stays and plays a sound.
 Started from Tsunyx's search boxes; the running ones show in uzunyx-clock.
